- Baseline and lab images contain Buildroot, the Linux kernel, BusyBox, bash
  and other packages, each under its own license (mostly GPL). Each baseline
  release includes its Buildroot manifest listing them.
- The browser pages load v86, which is under its own license (BSD-2-Clause).
